  m_Name: LiverInfo
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::OrganInfoData
  organName: Liver
  overview: The liver is a large, meaty organ sitting on the right side of the belly
    that is essential for digesting food and ridding the body of toxic substances.
  structure: "\u2022\tTwo main lobes (right and left)\r\n\u2022\tHepatic artery and
    portal vein\r\n\u2022\tBiliary tree"
  organFunction: "\u2022\tFilters toxins from the blood\r\n\u2022\tProduces bile
    for digestion"
  didYouKnow: The liver is the only organ in the human body that can regenerate itself
    completely from as little as 25% of its original tissue.
